# Local dev database and downloaded Moodle documents — real, often
# personal course content, and a SQLite file that changes on every local
# run/test. Production data lives under ESMERELDA_DATA_DIR instead (see
# storage/paths.py) — these were previously committed to git by mistake
# (added before this ignore rule existed; not removed from history by
# this change — see BUILD_LOG.md for that decision). Kept out of the repo
# going forward so no new commit accidentally includes real document
# content or a stale/corrupted local database.
